WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:16.716
Daisy: Hi, Kara.

2
00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:23.817
Kara: Come on in.

3
00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:33.456
Kara: We can work on our poster in the kitchen.

4
00:00:33.457 --> 00:00:36.066
Kara: I'll draw all the landmarks.

5
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:39.872
You can color everything in.

6
00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.672
Daisy: I like to draw too, you know.

7
00:00:42.673 --> 00:00:45.595
Kara: What?

8
00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:53.140
Daisy: Oh, never mind.

9
00:00:53.141 --> 00:00:56.337
Kara: That's not a good color for the slide.

10
00:00:56.338 --> 00:00:59.924
Kara: And the brick path looks really messy.

11
00:00:59.925 --> 00:01:04.141
Daisy: Kara! Stop bossing me around!

12
00:01:04.142 --> 00:01:05.779
Daisy: I'm the one who's coloring!

13
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.516
Not you!

14
00:01:07.517 --> 00:01:10.941
Kara: Well, I'm the one who's doing most of the work.

15
00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:15.036
Not you!

16
00:01:15.037 --> 00:01:22.094
Daisy: Fine. You can do ALL the work!

17
00:01:22.095 --> 00:01:24.748
Kara: Wait, Daisy. Don't go!

18
00:01:24.749 --> 00:01:26.412
Daisy: Why not?

19
00:01:26.413 --> 00:01:28.940
Kara: Because we're supposed to work together.

20
00:01:28.941 --> 00:01:32.267
Kara: And . . . I made something for you.

21
00:01:32.268 --> 00:01:33.776
Daisy: Really?

22
00:01:33.777 --> 00:01:41.348
Kara: Yes. Wait right here.

23
00:01:41.349 --> 00:01:43.629
Kara: It's a necklace.

24
00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.492
Daisy: It looks just like the one I lost!

25
00:01:46.493 --> 00:01:47.832
Kara: I know.

26
00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:50.492
Daisy: Wow. It's beautiful.

27
00:01:50.493 --> 00:01:53.139
That was so nice of you!

28
00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:54.682
Kara: I know.

29
00:01:54.683 --> 00:01:56.131
Now will you stay?

30
00:01:56.132 --> 00:01:57.737
Daisy: I guess so.

31
00:01:57.738 --> 00:01:59.667
Sorry about before.

32
00:01:59.668 --> 00:02:01.651
Kara: That's okay.

33
00:02:01.652 --> 00:02:05.081
But make sure you fix that messy spot.

34
00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:19.089
Kara: And the bike rack looks weird too . . .

35
00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:23.089
Miss Gray: Girls, your poster is beautiful.

36
00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:32.147
Miss Gray: See what you can do when you work together?

37
00:02:32.148 --> 00:02:35.347
Jenna: It was nice that Kara made you a new necklace.

38
00:02:35.348 --> 00:02:38.568
Jenna: Are you two friends now?

39
00:02:38.569 --> 00:02:44.980
Daisy: Umm . . . no. But I guess we're not enemies anymore!
